{"3242950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Outworld Station", "steam_appid": 3242950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>TAU</strong> System, <strong>Station Commander</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras/523de8c819062ebd7b1c63c8dc972342.avif?t=1786016284\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras_big/523de8c819062ebd7b1c63c8dc972342.avif?t=1786016284 width=800 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build, expand and exploit</strong> every resource you can to construct a planet-spanning space-based industrial complex the likes of which the galaxy has never seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct <strong>Robot Freighters, Wormholes</strong> and even harness the awesome power of <strong>Antimatter</strong> in your quest for ever-greater industrial mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras/7f8df50eb1edd4b4dccd8ebb5f19ca25.avif?t=1786016284\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras_big/7f8df50eb1edd4b4dccd8ebb5f19ca25.avif?t=1786016284 width=800 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atomize asteroids, mine ores, </strong>deploy<strong> cloud-miners</strong> and more to gather raw materials ready to be processed into advanced materials, items and parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up elaborate <strong>supply-chains</strong>, <strong>automate</strong> <strong>resource-gathering</strong> and <strong>optimize</strong> your stations to fulfill your objectives as efficiently as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras/7d3c2498c82b9f4348a6328aa9560295.avif?t=1786016284\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras_big/7d3c2498c82b9f4348a6328aa9560295.avif?t=1786016284 width=800 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct Starships</strong> to complete objectives and unlock ever-more-advanced technologies to aid you on your mission to bring this hostile alien star system to heel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Civilian</strong> and <strong>Military</strong> vessels will need vastly different and more complex construction techniques - some more <strong>dangerous</strong> to you and your station than others. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras/d6cc5ffb288b8abfa1a550c6ed94f5ec.avif?t=1786016284\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras_big/d6cc5ffb288b8abfa1a550c6ed94f5ec.avif?t=1786016284 width=800 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found</strong> <strong>multiple stations</strong> across <strong>numerous planets</strong> in order to exploit rare resources and connect them together via wormhole to create interstellar supply chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But beware</strong>: you are not the only force in this alien star system and you'll need to <strong>protect</strong> yourself and your station to thrive out here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras/263da02f3059b33f7209edaef91fda0f.avif?t=1786016284\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras_big/263da02f3059b33f7209edaef91fda0f.avif?t=1786016284 width=800 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover <strong>mysterious</strong> <strong>alien artifacts</strong> along the way and use them to unlock powerful upgrades for your Station and Drone - letting you take the fight to anything that stands in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong> your weapons, add shields or afterburners to navigate hostile areas with ease, or increase your station power and production efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras/7c4cd6db01730bd8c7678064bff3feff.avif?t=1786016284\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras_big/7c4cd6db01730bd8c7678064bff3feff.avif?t=1786016284 width=800 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join forces</strong> with up to <strong>4 players</strong> in <strong>online PVE co-op</strong> mode and share exploration, combat and construction tasks between you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share <strong>tasks and to-do lists</strong> between your team to fully maximise efficiency.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>TAU</strong> System, <strong>Station Commander</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras/523de8c819062ebd7b1c63c8dc972342.avif?t=1786016284\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras_big/523de8c819062ebd7b1c63c8dc972342.avif?t=1786016284 width=800 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build, expand and exploit</strong> every resource you can to construct a planet-spanning space-based industrial complex the likes of which the galaxy has never seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct <strong>Robot Freighters, Wormholes</strong> and even harness the awesome power of <strong>Antimatter</strong> in your quest for ever-greater industrial mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras/7f8df50eb1edd4b4dccd8ebb5f19ca25.avif?t=1786016284\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras_big/7f8df50eb1edd4b4dccd8ebb5f19ca25.avif?t=1786016284 width=800 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atomize asteroids, mine ores, </strong>deploy<strong> cloud-miners</strong> and more to gather raw materials ready to be processed into advanced materials, items and parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up elaborate <strong>supply-chains</strong>, <strong>automate</strong> <strong>resource-gathering</strong> and <strong>optimize</strong> your stations to fulfill your objectives as efficiently as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras/7d3c2498c82b9f4348a6328aa9560295.avif?t=1786016284\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras_big/7d3c2498c82b9f4348a6328aa9560295.avif?t=1786016284 width=800 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct Starships</strong> to complete objectives and unlock ever-more-advanced technologies to aid you on your mission to bring this hostile alien star system to heel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Civilian</strong> and <strong>Military</strong> vessels will need vastly different and more complex construction techniques - some more <strong>dangerous</strong> to you and your station than others. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras/d6cc5ffb288b8abfa1a550c6ed94f5ec.avif?t=1786016284\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras_big/d6cc5ffb288b8abfa1a550c6ed94f5ec.avif?t=1786016284 width=800 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found</strong> <strong>multiple stations</strong> across <strong>numerous planets</strong> in order to exploit rare resources and connect them together via wormhole to create interstellar supply chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But beware</strong>: you are not the only force in this alien star system and you'll need to <strong>protect</strong> yourself and your station to thrive out here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras/263da02f3059b33f7209edaef91fda0f.avif?t=1786016284\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras_big/263da02f3059b33f7209edaef91fda0f.avif?t=1786016284 width=800 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover <strong>mysterious</strong> <strong>alien artifacts</strong> along the way and use them to unlock powerful upgrades for your Station and Drone - letting you take the fight to anything that stands in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong> your weapons, add shields or afterburners to navigate hostile areas with ease, or increase your station power and production efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras/7c4cd6db01730bd8c7678064bff3feff.avif?t=1786016284\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/extras_big/7c4cd6db01730bd8c7678064bff3feff.avif?t=1786016284 width=800 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join forces</strong> with up to <strong>4 players</strong> in <strong>online PVE co-op</strong> mode and share exploration, combat and construction tasks between you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share <strong>tasks and to-do lists</strong> between your team to fully maximise efficiency.</p>", "short_description": "Take the helm as a new Station Commander and exploit an alien star system in this stunning space-station factory automation game. Amass resources and construct starships using increasingly advanced manufacturing and expand your station in a hostile universe.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Vietnamese, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Thai, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/e5e55c6f4b10303151dc964950b78b9ea501e7ac/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1786016284", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/323e59f17fe519898265f55b17f3ea6c3b4c2024/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1786016284", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242950/323e59f17fe519898265f55b17f3ea6c3b4c2024/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1786016284", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or Later (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core or AMD Ryzen processor (3 GHz or greater / 4 cores or greater)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></l